OL,3,GNEWSAMinor injuries after car crashes
OL,4,Ainto restaurant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car has crashed into a restaurant
OL,7,Fcausing road closures due to a gas
OL,8,Fleak.
OL,10,FThe incident happened at about 12:30
OL,11,FGMT on North John Street in Liverpool
OL,12,Fcity centre, when a Peugeot car hit the
OL,13,Fwindow of Tiger Rock Restaurant,
OL,14,FMerseyside Police said.
OL,16,FThe driver stayed at the scene and
OL,17,Fthere is no indication that this was a
OL,18,Fdeliberate act, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
